        content: "Claim. Let $s \\in R(\\Omega)$ with $\\mathrm{Im}(s) = 0$. Then $s = \\bar{r} \\in \\mathbb{R}$ and there is $\\delta \\in P_{s_r}(r)$ with $\\tilde{P}_\\delta(s) = 0$.";
