        content: "Theorem (Lemma 6.2). Let $F$ be an exposed face of $\\Omega$ with $\\dim\\mathrm{aff}(F) = 2$. Then\n$\\partial R(F) \\subseteq R(\\partial F)$: every boundary point of the root space of $F$ is a root on the\nrelative boundary (lemma62, Lemma62.lean:1446).";
        fontSize: 25;
        lineHeight: 1.42;
        color: "#24313f";
        math: true;
        animate {
            id: "a412";
