        width: 1680;
        height: 134;
        content: "The Lean proof splits on s_star.im = 0 (by_cases hreal): the real case (lemma62_real_case, this\nsection) goes through $P_{s_r}$ as in Lemma 6.1; the complex case (lemma62_complex_case) needs the $W$\n-matrix machinery— future work.";
        fontSize: 26;
